            "text": "```sql\nSELECT\n    AVG(DATE_DIFF(de.drug_era_start_date, de.previous_era_end_date, DAY)) AS average_days_between_treatment_eras\nFROM (\n    SELECT\n        person_id,\n        drug_concept_id,\n        drug_era_start_date,\n        drug_era_end_date,\n        LAG(drug_era_end_date, 1) OVER (PARTITION BY person_id, drug_concept_id ORDER BY drug_era_start_date) AS previous_era_end_date\n    FROM\n        `drug_era`\n    WHERE\n        drug_concept_id = 1304643\n) AS de\nWHERE\n    de.previous_era_end_date IS NOT NULL\n    AND DATE_DIFF(de.drug_era_start_date, de.previous_era_end_date, DAY) > 0\n```",
